From 86fd7d8578a8909a9c1e92a8423f46a200a85877 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 10:21:26 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] docs: README speed table shows each row's draft depth,
 drafter and key server flags

The 890M table now carries the recipe per row (draft depth, drafter file, key flags; the full lines stay in How we run it) and a dated note on the draft-depth-6 results for both 27B files measured after this release.

Origin: ArifiLabs (native) - release documentation for this fork; no upstream origin exists.
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED - documents only; no code path is touched.
---
 README.md | 33 +++++++++++++++++++--------------
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 704b6fa47b..b2577bbab1 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -12,20 +12,25 @@ July 2026; this is its third published release.
 
